":{"value":"reaction"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"MvZbqw8q3SM7Rx59","heightenedLevel":8,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.eG1fBodYwolaXK98","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"FoSt8dHrEP5DuOuC"},{"folder":"iDjm2cXyRAe4VZ35","img":"icons/magic/fire/explosion-flame-blue.webp","name":"Control Water (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>By imposing your will upon the water, you can raise or lower the level of water in the chosen area by 10 feet. Creatures that have the water trait and that are in the area when you Cast the Spell must attempt a Fortitude save, with the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WsUwpfmhKrKwoIe3]{Slow} spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Area</strong> 50 feet long by 50 feet wide</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"control-water","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"MvZbqw8q3SM7Rx59","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.zfn5RqAdF63neqpP","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"PRIjePcn6Uqgf61X"},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/magic/water/elemental-water.webp","name":"Water Breathing (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The targets can breathe underwater.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration increases to 8 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration increases to until your next daily preparations.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"water-breathing","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"up to 5 creatures"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1 minute"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"MvZbqw8q3SM7Rx59","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.MZGkMsPBztFN0pUO","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"c08UxzQfhHdm7et1"},{"folder":"wnvibtD90h7CStDC","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/tidal-surge.webp","name":"Tidal Surge (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You call forth a tremendous wave to move the target either in a body of water or on the ground. You move the target up to 10 feet in any direction along the ground or 20 feet through a body of water. An unwilling target can attempt a Fortitude save, and it avoids being moved if it succeeds.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"tidal-surge","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cleric","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"MvZbqw8q3SM7Rx59","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.iAnpxrLaBU4V6Sej","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"0lxSZZqliSRVqrPZ"},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/magic/water/wave-water-blue.webp","name":"Water Walk (Constant)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target can walk on the surface of water and other liquids without falling through. It can go underwater if it wishes, but in that case it must Swim normally. This spell doesn't grant the ability to breathe underwater.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell's range increases to 30 feet, the duration increases to 1 hour, and you can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"water-walk","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"MvZbqw8q3SM7Rx59","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"4":{"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Seaah9amXg70RKw2","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"V6F0rIvoNBzOQDLM"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Reactive Strike","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"reactive-strike","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.W7SbTykXrNwxDzJc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"B4HUAYMVUOqT3YWI"},{"type":"action","name":"Ward","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The matsugami is bound to a stretch of coastline. They can merge with or emerge from their ward as a single action with the concentrate trait. While merged, they are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}, but they recover Hit Points each minute as if they spent an entire day resting.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"8UEmGsxb5DKP7jOk","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Fist","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":"fist","traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["agile","magical","unarmed"]},"damageRolls":{"EQNskmyKZF7IYeho":{"damage":"3d6+18","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":35},"attackEffects":{"value":["improved-grab"]}},"_id":"Y8XvfhXlcTJuqGY3","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Improved Grab","system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedGrab]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"improved-grab","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.i18TlebMzwONyPhI","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"AkWwXVvEIlQpxtDZ"},{"type":"melee","name":"Foot","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":"foot","traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["magical","unarmed"]},"damageRolls":{"hGSfflMeQH3XQNml":{"damage":"3d12+18","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":35},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"Ru1OHCIDhP3JgcLN","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Disorienting Whirlpool","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The matsugami Swims twice, gathering the churning waters in their wake and pooling them around their fists. They then make a fist Strike. If the Strike hits, it catches the target in a condensed whirlpool, dealing an additional 3d6 bludgeoning damage and making the target @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} until the beginning of its next turn. If the Strike misses, the whirlpool spreads out into the surrounding water in a @Template[burst|distance:15]{15-foot radius} around the target. Until the start of the matsugami's next turn, any creature that enters or begins its turn in the whirlpool must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:40] save or take @Damage[3d6[bludgeoning]] damage and be off-guard until the beginning of its next turn. The whirlpool's waters are difficult to traverse, requiring a successful @Check[athletics|dc:35] check to Swim. Matsugami are immune to Disorienting Whirlpool.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"disorienting-whirlpool","toggleable":true},{"diceNumber":3,"dieSize":"d6","key":"DamageDice","selector":"fist-damage","damageType":"bludgeoning","predicate":["disorienting-whirlpool"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value"